# EXP-4a build-context filter (comix-parallel-engine-probe).
# The build context transfers over the SSH docker context (local-remote), so
# keep it SMALL. Only src/ (the manga_gateway package) + scripts/ (the harness)
# are needed; everything heavy/irrelevant is excluded.
*
!src/manga_gateway/**
!scripts/diagnose_comix_parallel_contention.py
!docker/exp4a-entrypoint.sh

# Re-exclude heavy / profile / cache artifacts that live UNDER the kept paths.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
src/manga_gateway/cloudflare-userdata/
src/manga_gateway/cloudflare-userdata-patchright/
src/manga_gateway/comix-userdata/
**/cloudflare-userdata/
**/cloudflare-userdata-patchright/
**/comix-userdata/
